{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"2f80e1d365c439e6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Bombastic fight with Polar bear security guy, He's a tough boss but simply charges and shoots at you, and it can be dodged.\n\nas fight continues on he gets more and more frustrated howeever, and starts using props from thee environment, with complete disregard for the safety of the people on his side.\n\nHe's reocurring, and becomes more and more unhinged each time. At the end he doesn't even care about his job, just capturing Pengu",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-400,
			"width":640,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"e525b2bc5a643bfd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Miku robot fight, There's a robotic pop-idol with the same voice as Miku, you end up appearing on stage alongside with her, but her programming has made her try to kill you, an evil killer robot.\n\nThe fight continues on in sync with the music, and everyone cheers on thinking it's part of the act. Giant lightbeams and confetti appear. \n\nWhen she's defeated for real, she comes to her robo-senses and apologizes. (if im still doing the guntool game, the robot could be made by the same company Aten goes through with the scary robots )",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":-400,
			"width":820,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"fc1bb97c8fe8732d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Mech v Mech fight,\ninspired by metal gear rising, all bars drop, and the game turns into speudo 3d, with the camera panning around you, the controls are still 2d, similar to Tekken. Bombastic metal music (ala MGS rising)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-100,
			"y":-20,
			"width":600,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"e8bd27c7a11159ef",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Travel across a moving train.\nYou escape across a moving train, that goes across the arctic, then the ocean, through cliff tunnels, and finally arriving at the border of the city",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":620,
			"y":-20,
			"width":580,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"cd9710f0e5ec9171",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Mech flying through the sky, a mini bullethell, where the dash button does quick directional dodges, and attack button shoots",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-140,
			"y":240,
			"width":540,
			"height":140
		}
	],
